chp_test.chp is AMC1.CHP from CNGSoft's CHIPNSFX package (http://cngsoft.no-ip.org/chipnsfx.zip, downloaded 2026-11-04), a CHIPNSFX song: a CNGSOFT transcription of a game tune, so the tune belongs to its original composer. The package is distributed with the tracker under GPL-3.0-or-later; the file is used unchanged, only as the chipnsfx-decode test fixture (row I432). ZX-Art serves this kind of file as kind CHP.
